    "Description": "Squid is a high-performance proxy caching server for web clients, supporting FTP, and HTTP data objects.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* squid-cache: Squid vulnerable to information disclosure via authentication credential leakage in error handling (CVE-2025-62168)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
